{
  "_comment": [
    "What tools/firefox-api-watch.mjs counts as relevant to FastStream in a Firefox release.",
    "keywords: regular expressions (case-insensitive) tried on a release-note bullet, a Bugzilla summary or a blog title.",
    "bcd: browser-compat-data path prefixes; a feature under one whose Firefox support starts or ends in the release is reported.",
    "WebExtensions are matched by what the extension uses (its chrome.*/browser.* namespaces and manifest keys), not listed here.",
    "priority: how much a match matters before the code check; a match whose API the code uses ranks higher.",
    "kind: the default kind of a new feature in this area (a removal is always a compatibility risk).",
    "modules: where FastStream's code for the area lives, named when no identifier of the change is found in the code.",
    "excludeText: changes in platform areas FastStream does not use, dropped whatever topic they match (tried on the change's text, not its section)."
  ],
